  "goodToKnow": "Der Prototyp is a prototype, the first model of a product: einen Prototyp testen, der Prototyp eines Elektroautos. Figuratively, it's the archetype: der Prototyp des Beamten, des Machos. Carl Benz's Patent-Motorwagen of 1886 is considered the prototype of the modern car. Der Typ also means type and, colloquially, guy. Plural: die Prototypen."
